Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.88,Short,,0,0,0,,When your cat sticks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.98,Short,,0,0,0,,its butt in your face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.16,Short,,0,0,0,,it's being polite
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.40,Short,,0,0,0,,A tail straight up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.32,Short,,0,0,0,,means hello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:06.86,Short,,0,0,0,,When two friendly cats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:07.23,Short,,0,0,0,,meet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.12,Short,,0,0,0,,they touch noses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.34,Short,,0,0,0,,then circle around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:09.90,Short,,0,0,0,,and sniff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.06,Short,,0,0,0,,each other's rear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.34,Short,,0,0,0,,Glands back there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.18,Short,,0,0,0,,give off a scent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:13.98,Short,,0,0,0,,that works like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:14.88,Short,,0,0,0,,an ID card
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.57,Short,,0,0,0,,unique to each cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:17.54,Short,,0,0,0,,Lifting the tail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.16,Short,,0,0,0,,is holding out the ID
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:20.32,Short,,0,0,0,,Kittens do it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:21.50,Short,,0,0,0,,for their mother, too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:22.36,Short,,0,0,0,,When your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:23.00,Short,,0,0,0,,turns around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.12,Short,,0,0,0,,and shows you its butt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:24.96,Short,,0,0,0,,it's greeting you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.74,Short,,0,0,0,,like family
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.14,Short,,0,0,0,,You're just not expected
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.08,Short,,0,0,0,,to sniff back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.02,Short,,0,0,0,,So next time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:29.44,Short,,0,0,0,,it happens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:30.33,Short,,0,0,0,,don't take it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:30.80,Short,,0,0,0,,personally
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:31.13,Short,,0,0,0,,because
